<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR edges up to 12.25 from 12.0pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR edges up to 12.25 from 12.0pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month edged up to 12.25 from 12.00 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) firmed to 11.61 from 11.38 percent.</p>
